[0.961, "o", "\u001b]0;⠐ Implement passkey authentication system\u0007"]
[0.038, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  Why a table instead of a signed cookie holding the challenge? Cookies are replayable and the challenge must be        \r\u001b[1B  single-use.\u001b[1CStoring\u001b[1Cserver-side,\u001b[1Cchecking-and-nulling,\u001b[1Cis\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Cclean\u001b[1Cpattern.\r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
