[0.002, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  That's the \"minimal\" payoff: the account-recovery surface area of a traditional auth system (~8 tables) collapses to  \r\u001b[1B  3.\r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m✻\u001b[1CChurned for 43s\u001b[80C\u001b[39m                     \r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n❯ \u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
