[0.074, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  1. \u001b[1mThe library uses the stored counter to run the check.\u001b[22m It compares the incoming signed counter to the one you passed\r\u001b[1B   in,\u001b[1Cand\u001b[1Cthrows\u001b[1Cif\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Cincoming\u001b[1Cone\u001b[1Cisn't\u001b[1Cgreater\u001b[1C(when\u001b[1Capplicable).\r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
