[0.852, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  All four take plain JS objects in and return plain JS objects out. Nothing is read from or written to anywhere. That's\r\u001b[1B   why\u001b[1Cevery\u001b[1Cexample\u001b[1Cin\u001b[1Ctheir\u001b[1Cdocs\u001b[1Chas\u001b[1C\"…now\u001b[1Cstore\u001b[1Cthis\u001b[1Cin\u001b[1Cyour\u001b[1Cdatabase\"\u001b[1C/\u001b[1C\"…now\u001b[1Clook\u001b[1Cthis\u001b[1Cup\u001b[1Cin\u001b[1Cyour\u001b[1Cdatabase\"\u001b[1Cprose\r\u001b[1B  around the calls — the persistence is entirely your problem.                                                          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B            \u001b[83C                     \r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m──────────────────────"]
