[0.288, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  A single credential can have multiple transports. A YubiKey 5 NFC reports \u001b[38;2;87;105;247m[\"usb\", \"nfc\"]\u001b[39m. An iCloud-synced passkey    \r\u001b[1B  originally\u001b[1Cregistered\u001b[1Con\u001b[1Can\u001b[1CiPhone\u001b[1Ctypically\u001b[1Creports\u001b[1C\u001b[38;2;87;105;247m[\"internal\", \"hybrid\"]\u001b[1C\u001b[39m—\u001b[1C\"internal\"\u001b[1Cbecause\u001b[1Cit's\u001b[1Con\u001b[1C\u001b[3mthis\u001b[1C\u001b[23mdevice,\r\u001b[1B  \"hybrid\" because it can be projected to other devices via QR.                                                         \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B            \u001b[83C                     \r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[1mHow\u001b[1Cit\u001b[1Cflows\u001b[1Cthrough\u001b[1Cyour\u001b[1Csystem\u001b[22m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7"]
