[0.736, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  The browser reads this and decides which UI to show. With \u001b[38;2;87;105;247m[\"internal\"]\u001b[39m it'll go straight to a Touch ID prompt. With   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;87;105;247m[\"hybrid\"]\u001b[1C\u001b[39mit'll\u001b[1Cshow\u001b[1C\"Use\u001b[1Ca\u001b[1Cdevice\u001b[1Cnearby\"\u001b[1Cwith\u001b[1Ca\u001b[1CQR\u001b[1Ccode.\u001b[1CWith\u001b[1Cboth,\u001b[1Cyou\u001b[1Cget\u001b[1Ca\u001b[1Cpicker.\r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m──────────────────────────────────────"]
