[0.105, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  \u001b[1m1. Authenticator\u001b[22m — yes, but not \"browser plugin.\" It's a component that holds private keys and performs signing, and  \r\u001b[1B  it's\u001b[1Calways\u001b[1Cone\u001b[1Cof:\r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
