[0.307, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  \u001b[1m2. Browser\u001b[22m — yes, with one important naming detail. There are actually \u001b[1mtwo\u001b[22m protocols here, and conflating them causes \r\u001b[1B  confusion\u001b[1Clater:\r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
