[0.961, "o", "\u001b]0;⠂ Implement passkey authentication system\u0007"]
[0.035, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[2C\u001b[5A-\u001b[1CThey\u001b[1Ccommunicate\u001b[1Cvia\u001b[1Ca\u001b[1CBLE\u001b[1Cproximity\u001b[1Ccheck\u001b[1C\u001b[3mplus\u001b[1C\u001b[23man\u001b[1Cend-to-end-encrypted\u001b[1Ctunnel\u001b[1Crelayed\u001b[1Cthrough\u001b[1Ca\u001b[1Ccloud\u001b[1Cservice\u001b[1Crun\r\u001b[1B  by Apple or Google.                                                                                                   \r\u001b[1B   \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m           \u001b[83C                     \r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m--\u001b[1CINSERT\u001b[1C--\u001b[83CNow\u001b[1Cusing\u001b[1Cextra\u001b[1Cusage\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[3A\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.931, "o", "\u001b]0;⠐ Implement passkey authentication system\u0007"]
[0.271, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  So the \"client\" role spans two devices. But conceptually the phone is still acting purely as an authenticator — it    \r\u001b[1B  signs\u001b[1Cchallenges\u001b[1Cfor\u001b[1Can\u001b[1CRP\u001b[1Cit\u001b[1Cnever\u001b[1Cdirectly\u001b[1Cconnects\u001b[1Cto.\u001b[1CThe\u001b[1Cbrowser\u001b[1Cis\u001b[1Cstill\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Csole\u001b[1Cmediator\u001b[1Cwith\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Cserver.\r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mOne more thing worth pinning down\u001b[62C\u001b[22m                     \r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m--\u001b[1CINSERT\u001b[1C--\u001b[83CNow\u001b[1Cusing\u001b[1Cextra\u001b[1Cusage\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[3A\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.685, "o", "\u001b]0;⠂ Implement passkey authentication system\u0007"]
[0.965, "o", "\u001b]0;⠐ Implement passkey authentication system\u0007"]
[0.961, "o", "\u001b]0;⠂ Implement passkey authentication system\u0007"]
[0.141, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  The RP never talks to the authenticator and never knows which authenticator was used (with the important exception of \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[1mattestation\u001b[1C\u001b[22m—\u001b[1Ca\u001b[1Csigned\u001b[1Cstatement\u001b[1Cfrom\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Cauthenticator\u001b[1Cabout\u001b[1Citself,\u001b[1Cwhich\u001b[1Ccan\u001b[1Creveal\u001b[1Cmake/model\u001b[1Cvia\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1CAAGUID).\u001b[1CBy\r\u001b[1B  default attestation is \"none\" and the RP learns nothing about the hardware. That's deliberate: privacy. If you ever   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bneed to enforce\u001b[1C\"only\u001b[1Chardware\u001b[1Ckeys\u001b[1Callowed,\"\u001b[1Cattestation\u001b[1Cis\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Clever,\u001b[1Cbut\u001b[1C99%\u001b[1Cof\u001b[1Capps\u001b[1Cnever\u001b[1Ctouch it.             \r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[1CKneading…\u001b[1C\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m(37s\u001b[1C·\u001b[1C↓\u001b[1C1.0k\u001b[1Ctokens)\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m \u001b[1C⎿\u001b[1C Tip:\u001b[1CUse\u001b[1C/btw\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1Cask\u001b[1Ca\u001b[1Cquick\u001b[1Cside\u001b[1Cquestion\u001b[1Cwithout\u001b[1Cinterrupting\u001b[1CClaude's\u001b[1Ccurrent\u001b[1Cwork\u001b[39m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m--\u001b[1CINSERT\u001b[1C--\u001b[83CNow\u001b[1Cusing\u001b[1Cextra\u001b[1Cusage\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[3A\u001b[?2026l"]
