[0.089, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[74D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[74C\u001b[3Ae\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[75C\u001b[3A\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.153, "o", "\u001b]0;⠂ Implement passkey authentication system\u0007"]
[0.003, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[75D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[11A\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m\u001b[38;2;175;175;175m❯ \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mThat's very helpful. Let's invent the notion of a “receipt book”. We can make up one of those whimsical names like \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mGithub does for codespaces (neon-flying-newt or whatever), and let the user rename it. In the UI it is the “nickname”\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0m for the “receipt book”.\u001b[39m                                                                                              \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mThere's a little tension down the line if one user wants multiple receipt sets (maybe a confusing UX concept). Hmm \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mmaybe that's mixing a within-account and an account-level setting.\u001b[39m                                                    \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                             "]
[0.000, "o", "           \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mBasically I'm trying to get a good UI story for what to call the nickname\u001b[39m                                             \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m         \u001b[1C   \u001b[1C      \u001b[1C  \u001b[1C   \u001b[1C \u001b[1C    \u001b[1C  \u001b[1C     \u001b[1C   \u001b[1C    \u001b[1C  \u001b[1C    \u001b[1C   \u001b[1C         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;215;119;87mHashing… \u001b[39m                                                                                                             \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B            \r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m───────────────────────────────"]
