[0.828, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  The recovery token is the key security boundary. Single-use, short-lived, tied to an IP and a user agent, stored      \r\u001b[1B  server-side.\r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
