[0.379, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  Buys: a recovery path that doesn't require collecting email, phone, or security questions. Unique to an app that      \r\u001b[1B  already\u001b[1Chas\u001b[1Cuser-specific\u001b[1Ccontent\u001b[1Cwith\u001b[1Ccryptographic\u001b[1Cfingerprints\u001b[1C—\u001b[1Cwouldn't\u001b[1Cwork\u001b[1Cfor\u001b[1Ca\u001b[1Cgeneric\u001b[1Cservice.\u001b[1CAesthetically\r\u001b[1B   pleasing because the recovery capability emerges from the data the app is already about.                             \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B            \r\r\n\u001b[2CCosts:\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m─────────────────────────────────"]
