[0.454, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  For a demo/hobby project this is a fun and defensible choice. For anything with real money or sensitive data you'd    \r\u001b[1B  want\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1Cadd\u001b[1Ca\u001b[1Csecond\u001b[1Crecovery\u001b[1Cfactor\u001b[1Canyway\u001b[1C(email\u001b[1Cor\u001b[1Crecovery\u001b[1Ccode\u001b[1Cat\u001b[1Csignup),\u001b[1Cbut\u001b[1Cyou\u001b[1Ccan\u001b[1Cabsolutely\u001b[1Cship\u001b[1Cthe\r\u001b[1B  hash-based one as the \u001b[3mprimary\u001b[23m story and offer a \"generate a recovery code\" secondary factor for users who want it.    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B            \r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m──────────────────────────────────"]
