[0.335, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  The attack being mitigated is \u001b[1mCSRF\u001b[22m: a page on \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mevil.com\u001b[39m tricks the user's browser into submitting \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mPOST \u001b[39m                \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mhttps://yoursite.com/api/...\u001b[39m,\u001b[1Cand\u001b[1Cif\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Csession\u001b[1Ccookie\u001b[1Cgets\u001b[1Cattached\u001b[1Cautomatically,\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Caction\u001b[1Chappens\u001b[1Cas\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Cuser\r\u001b[1B  with no consent. The \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mSameSite\u001b[39m attribute lets the browser refuse to attach the cookie on those cross-site triggered    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Brequests.   \r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m──────"]
