[0.580, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  \u001b[1mFor this app\u001b[22m: Lax is right. The frontend and backend are same-origin (or can be made so via Vite proxy), so all       \r\u001b[1B  legitimate\u001b[1Crequests\u001b[1Care\u001b[1Csame-site\u001b[1Cand\u001b[1Ccarry\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Ccookie.\u001b[1CThe\u001b[1Conly\u001b[1Ccross-site\u001b[1Crequests\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1CAPI\u001b[1Cwould\u001b[1Cbe\u001b[1CCSRF\r\u001b[1B  attempts, and Lax refuses to help them.                                                                               \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B            \r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m--\u001b[1CINSERT\u001b[1C--\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[3A\u001b[?2026l"]
