[0.027, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  So \u001b[38;2;87;105;247muser_id\u001b[39m is NULL from step 1 until step 3 succeeds. In wall-clock terms that's usually 5–30 seconds, but the TTL    \r\u001b[1B  gives\u001b[1Cit\u001b[1Cup\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1C5\u001b[1Cminutes\u001b[1Cbefore\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Cpruner\u001b[1Cdeletes\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Crow.\r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhy the pre-auth period has to exist\u001b[22m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m──────────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m--\u001b[1CINSERT\u001b[1C--\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[3A\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.937, "o", "\u001b]0;⠂ Implement passkey authentication system\u0007"]
[0.506, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  The challenge is server-generated, must be single-use, and must be matched at verify time. Somewhere between /options \r\u001b[1B  and\u001b[1C/verify,\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Cserver\u001b[1Cneeds\u001b[1Ca\u001b[1Cplace\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1Cremember\u001b[1C\"I\u001b[1Csent\u001b[1C\u001b[3mthis\u001b[1C\u001b[23mchallenge\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1C\u001b[3mthis\u001b[1C\u001b[23mbrowser.\"\u001b[1CThe\u001b[1Cbrowser\u001b[1Ccan't\u001b[1Cbe\r\u001b[1B  trusted to return it unmodified — that would let an attacker replay an old challenge. So:                             \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B            \r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m──────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m--\u001b[1CINSERT\u001b[1C--\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[3A\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.410, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  - Server mints challenge, stores it server-side keyed by \u001b[3msomething the browser has\u001b[23m.                                   \r\u001b[1B   \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m           \r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m--\u001b[1CINSERT\u001b[1C--\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[3A\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.048, "o", "\u001b]0;⠐ Implement passkey authentication system\u0007"]
