[0.452, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  That's the whole reason \u001b[38;2;87;105;247msessions.user_id\u001b[39m is nullable. The row has to exist to hold the challenge, but there's nothing \r\u001b[1B  to\u001b[1Cset\u001b[1C\u001b[38;2;87;105;247muser_id\u001b[1C\u001b[39mto\u001b[1Cyet.\r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
