[0.024, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[6A\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m⏺\u001b[1C\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=rllb24;file:///Users/joe/src/receipt-scanner-demo/receipt-design.md\u0007receipt-design.md\u001b]8;;\u0007)       \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;87;105;247m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;87;105;247m\u001b[1mEdit file\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mreceipt-design.md\u001b[39m                                                                                                      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;175;175;175m╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌"]
[0.000, "o", "╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m…\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;175;175;175m╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1CDo\u001b[1Cyou\u001b[1Cwant\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1Cmake\u001b[1Cthis\u001b[1Cedit\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1C\u001b[1mreceipt-design.md\u001b[22m?\r\r\n\u001b[1C\u001b[38;2;87;105;247m❯\u001b[1C\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m1.\u001b[1C\u001b[38;2;87;105;247mYes\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3C\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m2.\u001b[1C\u001b[39mYes,\u001b[1Callow\u001b[1Call\u001b[1Cedits\u001b[1Cduring\u001b[1Cthis\u001b[1Csession\u001b[1C\u001b[1m(shift+tab)\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[3C\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m3.\u001b[1C\u001b[39mNo\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1C\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mEsc\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1Ccancel\u001b[1C·\u001b[1CTab\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1Camend\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1C\u001b[5A\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b]0;✳ Implement passkey authentication system\u0007"]
[0.301, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[1D\u001b[5B\r\u001b[8A\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m 306 \u001b[22m - **Soft deletes.** `receipt_items` currently deletes via `DELETE FROM receipt_items` on both cascade (from receip\r\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m t delete) and explicit item removal in the `update` flow. For a tool users correct by hand this throws away the on\r\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m ly record of what the AI originally extracted and what they changed. A `deleted_at TIMESTAMP NULL` column, with re\r\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m ads filtering `WHERE deleted_at IS NULL` and deletes being `UPDATE … SET deleted_at = now()`, would preserve an au\r\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m dit trail, enable undo, and keep stats honest. Same argument probably applies to `receipts` itself. Deferred becau\r\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[22m se nothing depends on it yet; revisit before anyone's data matters.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 307 \u001b[22m \r\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 308 \u001b[22m - **More explicit mid-auth state representation.** The `sessions` table uses nullable `user_id` / `challenge` to r\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m \u001b[4C\u001b[22m epresent\u001b[1C\"pre-auth\u001b[1Cceremony\u001b[1Cin\u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[1Cflight\"\u001b[1Cvs.\u001b[1C\"authenticated\u001b[1Csession.\"\u001b[1CWorks,\u001b[1Cmatches\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Cindustry-standard\u001b[1Cshape,\u001b[1Cbu\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m \u001b[4C\u001b[22m t\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Cstate\u001b[1Cmachine\u001b[1Cisn't\u001b[1Cenforced\u001b[1Cby\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Cschema\u001b[1C—\u001b[1C`requireAuth`'s\u001b[1Ccheck\u001b[1Con\u001b[1C`req.user`\u001b[1Cis\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Conly\u001b[1Cthing\u001b[1Ckeeping\u001b[1Ca\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m \u001b[4C\u001b[22m \u001b[1Chalf-initialized\u001b[1Crow\u001b[1Cfrom\u001b[1Cbeing\u001b[1Ctreated\u001b[1Cas\u001b[1Cauthenticated.\u001b[1CUpgrade\u001b[1Coptions,\u001b[1Ccheapest\u001b[1Cfirst:\u001b[1C(a)\u001b[1Ca\u001b[1C`CHECK`\u001b[1Cconstrai\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m \u001b[4C\u001b[22m nt\u001b[1Cmaking\u001b[1Cinvalid\u001b[1Ccombinations\u001b[1Cun-insertable;\u001b[1C(b)\u001b[1Can\u001b[1Cexplicit\u001b[1C`state`\u001b[1Ccolumn\u001b[1C(`'pending'\u001b[1C|\u001b[1C'authenticated'`)\u001b[1Cwith\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m \u001b[4C\u001b[22m a\u001b[1CCHECK\u001b[1Ctying\u001b[1Cit\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1C`user_id`\u001b[1Cpresence;\u001b[1C(c)\u001b[1Csplit\u001b[1Cinto\u001b[1C`pending_ceremonies`\u001b[1Cand\u001b[1C`sessions`\u001b[1Cas\u001b[1Cseparate\u001b[1Ctables,\u001b[1Crot\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m \u001b[4C\u001b[22m ate\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Ccookie\u001b[1Cat\u001b[1Cverify\u001b[1Ctime.\u001b[1C(a)\u001b[1Cis\u001b[1Ca\u001b[1Cone"]
[0.000, "o", "-line\u001b[1Caddition\u001b[1Cwhenever\u001b[1Cwe\u001b[1Cwant\u001b[1Cit.\u001b[1C(c)\u001b[1Cis\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Cright\u001b[1Cshape\u001b[1Cif\u001b[1Cwe\u001b[1Cever\u001b[1Cg\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m\u001b[2m \u001b[4C\u001b[22m o\u001b[1Cmulti-process\u001b[1Cor\u001b[1Cwant\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Cschema\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1Crefuse\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1Crepresent\u001b[1Can\u001b[1Cunauthenticated\u001b[1C\"session.\"\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m\u001b[48;2;220;255;220m 309 +\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m                                                                                                                  \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m\u001b[48;2;220;255;220m 310 +\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m- **\"Receipt book\" → \"account of receipt books\" migration.** Current model collapses account and receipt book into\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m\u001b[48;2;220;255;220m     +\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m a single `users` row (`display_name` = the whimsical name shown in-app and in the keychain). Cheap because passke\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m\u001b[48;2;220;255;220m     +\u001b[38;2;51;51;51my signup is near-instant, so users who want separate sets create separate books (= separate passkeys + sessions). \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m\u001b[48;2;220;255;220m     +\u001b[38;2;51;51;51mWe lose cross-book features: no combined search across books, no in-app switcher, no shared settings, no moving a \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m\u001b[48;2;220;255;220m     +\u001b[38;2;51;51;51mreceipt from one book to another without re-uploading. Upgrade path when any of those become requirements: add a `\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m\u001b[48;2;220;255;220m     +\u001b[38;2;51;51;51mbooks` table (`id`, `user_id`, `display_name`, `created_at`), move `receipts.user_id` → `receipts.book_id`, demote\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m\u001b[48;2;220;255;220m     +\u001b[38;2;51;51;51m `users.display_name` to a barely-surfaced \"profile name,\" rename the user-facing noun from \"receipt book\" (= the \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m\u001b[48;2;220;255;220m     +\u001b[38;2;51;51;51maccount) to \"book\" (= the child collection). Existing users become one-book users automatically via a backfill. Th\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m\u001b[48;2;220;255;220m     +\u001b[38;2;51;51;51me auth layer doesn't change. Estimate"]
[0.000, "o", "d cost: a day, no data loss. Flagging now so we don't unconsciously design fe\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m\u001b[48;2;220;255;220m     +\u001b[38;2;51;51;51matures that make the migration harder (e.g., encoding the book name into URLs or external IDs in a way that would \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;36;138;61m\u001b[48;2;220;255;220m     +\u001b[38;2;51;51;51mbreak if a user had multiple).                                                                                    \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;175;175;175m╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1CDo\u001b[1Cyou\u001b[1Cwant\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1Cmake\u001b[1Cthis\u001b[1Cedit\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1C\u001b[1mreceipt-design.md\u001b[22m?\r\r\n\u001b[1C\u001b[38;2;87;105;247m❯\u001b[1C\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m1.\u001b[1C\u001b[38;2;87;105;247mYes\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3"]
